50:That server hands its startup environment to every window created afterwards, and `NO_COLOR` is not in tmux's default
 `update-environment` set, so a later client attach does not repair it.
51:Firstmate therefore drops the launcher's color control (`NO_COLOR`, `FORCE_COLOR`, `CLICOLOR`, `CLICOLOR_FORCE`) befo
re that one `new-session`, so an agent-launched Firstmate cannot leave every crew pane monochrome.
